  "worked_solution": "We apply the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ 0.5 & =P(A)+0.3-0.2 \\\\ P(A) & =0.5+0.2-0.3 \\\\ P(A) & =0.4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo check our answer, we can construct the corresponding Venn diagram:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14284903/assets/e39a13dc19a6131904692f07c2481da3bc26e6430337a61b3be80bb9ec19dc12.png)",
